WEBVTT

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:08.750
Minamoto-senpai.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.500
Sagami-san, you wanted to talk?

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:13.250
You know about that?

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:17.580
That hospital can transform and turn into a robot.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.750
What?! Really?!

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:20.750
I'm kidding.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:21.790
Huh?!

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.500
Even if they're not quite as sharp as me,
the underworld's full of formidable people.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.660
Senpai, you're too pure-hearted and not cut out for it.
You should give up on the whole idea.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:34.250
If you still want to join Tsukikage despite all that...

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.910
...head to Wasabi and please order the following:

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:42.500
Original curry, without honey,
and with lots of garam masala.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.500
I'm not cut out for it?

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.700
I'll show you!

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:55.120
I won't waver anymore! After all,
I've decided that I'm going to protect this city!

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.250
Welcome!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:35.790
"Original curry, without honey,
and with lots of garam masala"!

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:38.200
Head right this way.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:38.790
Open

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:40.160
Preparing to open

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:44.540
I'm Momo Minamoto.
I never formally introduced myself before.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.750
I'm Katrina Tobey.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.250
What?! An elevator?!

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:55.620
You haven't seen anything yet.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.700
Oh my...!

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.660
But aren't we underground?!

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.160
Good luck.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:20.250
We were waiting for you, Momo-chan.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.950
Let's give her a warm welcome!

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:26.790
That sure was a surprise...

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:29.910
Fu-chan, you reacted the same way at first, didn't you?

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:32.660
I-I did a better job playing it cool!

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:36.700
Welcome to Tsukikage's secret base!

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:38.290
It's so flashy...

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:42.200
Since long ago, this city has flourished
as an important transportation center,

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.750
but back then, public security wasn't good.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:50.410
So a vigilante group was formed to protect the city.
That marked the beginning of Tsukikage.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:55.450
The founder was a woman who traded in spices overseas.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:04:00.790
The foundation that manages the vast wealth
she left behind is Tsukikage's parent organization.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:03.660
So that's why you've got such an amazing base...

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:06.620
From then on, Tsukikage has been a
private intelligence agency that stands for justice

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.250
and is not affiliated with any nation...

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:12.000
So that means we work as spies
and fight crime syndicates.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:15.040
Huh?! What now?!

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:18.750
Nothing to worry about! It's just registering your face.

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:31.000
It's because we've got facilities like this
that we're able to operate the way we do.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.450
This is like something out of a movie, you know?

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:39.700
This is how we get in touch with other private
intelligence agencies all around the world.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:44.580
Since the start of the 21st century, the international
situation has been changing at a dizzying pace,

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:48.370
so we've also developed
a cooperative relationship with the police.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.830
Did you know? "Spy" is derived from the word "spice"...

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:54.870
In other words, it's basically an abbreviation of "spice."

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.040
Really...?!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.950
But note... that's simply one theory.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.080
Ninja...?!

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.200
Wow...!

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.660
Amazing!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.750
These secret items are things that're natural for us
to be carrying around on a regular basis.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:20.120
A real spy is able to make good use of this stuff.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:22.950
At a glance, this looks like hand cream...

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:28.450
But when applied, it acts as optical camouflage.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:29.410
Whoa...

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.620
The effect immediately fades
when not applied to bare skin,

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.910
so becoming fully invisible means getting nude first.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.750
The effect lasts for 10-odd seconds.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.410
Isn't that a bit short?!

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:43.830
Liquid shoots out of this anti-groping buzzer. It can
be used for stuff like temporarily blinding someone.

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:45.370
Wait, was all of this...

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.580
Yep, I made it all!

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.750
There's also a hairpin for picking locks...

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.250
Settle down, Hatsume, we need to explain this first.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.660
Tsukikage's lifeblood: Spyce.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.160
"Spyce"...

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:02.500
Consuming it stimulates your brain and gives
you superhuman agility for a brief time.

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:07.080
It's not something I made myself. It's a secret tool
that's been passed down since long ago.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.790
Carry one stick with you as a good-luck charm.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.870
It only works on young girls, you know.

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:18.040
When its effectiveness drops,
you graduate from the ranks of Tsukikage.

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:20.410
So this's something you graduate from, huh?

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:25.160
After graduating, you have the choice of continuing
to support Tsukikage as a collaborator,

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:29.160
or you can have all recollection of Tsukikage
wiped from your mind and lead a normal life.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:34.790
Wasabi's manager, Katrina-san, is a former
Tsukikage member and was in fact my mentor.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.120
"Mentor"...

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.450
Tsukikage is a small elite force.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:43.830
During one's time as an active member, they train
an apprentice and pass on their skills and spirit.

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.830
By the way, Fu is my apprentice!

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.620
Which means that...

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.580
I'm Goe-chan's mentor.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:52.660
I'm her apprentice.

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:53.910
Ooh!

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:58.660
S-so, then... that makes me
Hanzomon-senpai's apprentice, right?!

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.620
Call me "Mentor."

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.000
"Mentor"!

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:03.370
First, you'll need training.

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:07.330
If you train hard and pass the test,
you'll officially be a member of Tsukikage.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:09.870
Will you really be able to pull it off?

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:12.080
I sure will! I'll do it!

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:14.620
Do your best! I'm rooting for you!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.790
You can do it, Momochi! Probably!

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:17.950
Yeah!

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:21.370
Let's get straight into it. Come to my house tonight.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.290
Huh?

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.450
Yes, Mentor!

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:33.870
You're five minutes early...

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:37.620
In the future, be ready to go 30 minutes ahead of time.

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:38.750
O-okay!

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:41.830
Huh?

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.950
In the world of spies, you're always on the battlefield.

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:46.950
From now on, I'll attempt
to stamp this on you without warning.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:49.540
React and make it so that you're able
to guard against me doing it.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:50.450
Okay...

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.790
I take pride in my tea... It's delicious.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.950
Th-thanks.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:03.660
This tastes weird...

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.330
But it's tea my mentor made for me...!

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:15.410
You should've realized the change in height.

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:20.370
Telling lies... wearing disguises...
putting poison in things...

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:23.910
Learn from this experience that such things
are commonplace for a spy.

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:26.080
U-understood...

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:30.950
From now on, no matter who it is giving you food
or a drink, make a habit of always testing it for poison.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.910
Uh, um...?

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.450
I brought you here.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:42.700
Mentor...

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.910
Now that we're mentor and apprentice,

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:49.370
it's necessary for both of us to understand
what it is that the other is fighting for.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.500
I really love this city.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.750
So you do too, then!

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:06.580
Sorasaki, which generation after generation
of Tsukikage members have risked their lives to protect,

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:10.620
is now a major industrial zone
and one of the country's main arteries.

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:15.250
So, I like this city and also this view.

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.410
I'm proud to live in Sorasaki.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:22.040
It's a great city, isn't it? It's so lively.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:25.910
Yeah. It's filled with thoughts and feelings of its residents.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:33.250
I've lived near the shopping district for a long time,
and all of the people there are so kind...

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:35.950
So, I really want to protect them!

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:41.500
My dad was the one who first showed me this view...

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:45.160
But, I see you knew about it too, huh?

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:46.950
Guess that's no surprise...

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:53.370
A long time ago, I was also introduced
to this place by someone dear to me.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:55.950
Mentor...?

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:59.040
We both choose to fight for the same reasons.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:00.580
Come with me.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.500
I look forward to training with you, Mentor!

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:13.040
Even if you use Spyce to get stronger,
it won't matter if you're not versed in the basics.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:14.540
Got it, Mentor!

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.120
Right in the middle of THIS?!

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:18.620
You're always on the battlefield.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:22.410
I'll have you fight with a sword, same as me.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:23.080
Understood!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.830
Be prepared for any kind of environment!

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:28.200
O-okay!

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:29.580
This training is being conducted under special direction.
Please do not attempt this.

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:34.040
Goe-chan, your massage is working wonders...

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:35.580
So, how is it?

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:38.500
It's been super tough,
but I think I'll make it through somehow!

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:39.580
Three days later...

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:45.120
My whole body hurts...

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:48.870
Mentor
Roof

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:52.080
Aah... I've gotta go.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.040
I wonder if she'll be alright.

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:58.500
Just a personal feeling, but I think she'll be fine.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:03.620
You're late. You should've been able
to get here 30 seconds ago.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:07.080
Sorry, Mentor. My body aches...

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:10.580
Think enemies will stop attacking you
if you tell them your body aches?

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:11.370
Uh...

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:16.410
The password "without honey" represents
how the spy's way of life is absent of sweetness.

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.080
That's the world you're trying to enter, you know.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.080
If you're not okay with that, quit now.

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:29.200
10km run
100 squats
200 sit-ups
Break
500 Practice swings
Sparring
Stretches
Clean dojo
Head Home
Eat

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.950
That's your schedule going forward.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.750
Hurry and get up.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:40.950
I'll leave you behind.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:47.200
It wouldn't hurt her to worry about me at least a little...

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:00.160
Mentor...

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.700
She put weights on herself...

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.830
Good evening, Momo-chan.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.160
Oh, Hatsume-san!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:16.950
You looked pretty sore. So, as your friend,
I brought you a little something.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.950
Massage Belt No. 1!

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:20.500
I-I see...

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:23.370
I see Yuki-chan is practicing.

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:26.120
Well then, sorry for interrupting.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:30.790
U-um... Does my mentor always train that way?

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:34.790
Yes, every single day since she was young.

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:43.620
Mentor, I got overly excited!

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:48.040
So I took it for granted that you'd
go easy on me and I fell... I'm sorry!

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:51.620
Now that you've picked yourself up, follow my lead.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:53.830
Certainly! I'm right with you!

00:12:56.500 --> 00:13:00.700
Keeping up with Yuki for 10 days is no joke, Momochi.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:03.540
I'm gonna continue full steam ahead and pass the test!

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:06.950
Oh, the test... It involves playing tag with me, you know.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:07.830
Huh?

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:10.330
Wanna give it a try?

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:14.370
If you can catch me, then you pass the test
right here and now.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.540
Don't hold back!

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:19.580
Just try and catch me.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.870
Wha...?!

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:26.620
Acrobatics?!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.830
I've gotta drill a whole lot more...

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:33.290
I'm absolutely going to pass that test.

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:36.990
FIRST CHALLENGE

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:39.990
FIRST CHALLENGE

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:47.620
By the time I finish drinking this, go get
the contact details of someone who you don't know.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:48.700
Huh?

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:50.080
It's practice for your conversation skills.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:52.500
Your training has entered the second phase.

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.250
One of those people over there?

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.540
Wh-who should I try to talk to?

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:05.160
He looks stern...

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.410
She looks scary...

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.620
E-excuse me! Do you have a minute?!

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:15.750
Y-yes?!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:21.450
There's nothing suspicious about me...
I'd just like to talk to you a bit... please.

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:26.080
You're a student at Sorasaki High School, aren't you?

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:31.410
Y-yeah, I am! Same school! We go to the same school!
Um, what year are you?

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:33.580
I'm a second-year...

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.250
Same as me, then.

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:39.200
I'm Momo Minamoto from Class C.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:41.950
I'm Nagi Hokuto from Class A...

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:44.750
Will you please be my friend?

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.910
Uh... um... okay?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:51.370
I-I got someone's contact details.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.410
You took too long.

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:59.200
It's time to practice not letting your feelings show.

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:00.660
Okay.

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:05.160
For the next three minutes, no matter what happens,
do not look surprised.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:06.290
Got it!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:12.040
Fail!

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:18.120
I was able to decrypt a portion of the data
we retrieved from the factory.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:21.000
Is that a... flower?

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:23.620
It's the blueprint for a building...

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:26.040
but the concrete details are still unknown.

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:30.120
We raided that factory based on suspicions
the place was linked to Moryo...

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:32.410
and we got our hands on something big, huh?

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.330
Moryo...

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:37.200
What are they scheming this time?

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.330
Was there any other data on there?

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:41.120
Nope, that was about it.

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.000
Note: The Japanese word "gekkako" means "tuberose."

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.120
Nope, that was about it.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.000
How's the tuberose coming along?

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:48.500
It's currently being made in Vietnam.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.330
It will be completed in the summer.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.750
That'll do fine.

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:55.950
Have we received any information from
the Tsukikage spy who changed over to our side?

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:58.080
Just various bits and pieces.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:00.750
But it seems all of the intel checks out.

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:02.790
Apparently, she expects some cash in return.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:04.950
We still can't trust her just yet.

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:07.450
What's with all this complicated talk?!

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:10.040
Remember that I'm the unbeatable Byakko!

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:12.950
Just let me do my job already!

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:18.290
Shut up, Shorty. Just sit tight like my beautiful self.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.160
Huh?!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.080
Your time will come soon.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:23.950
First, we need to have a talk with our collaborators.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.120
You're completely open to attack.

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:45.500
As a penalty, do a lap around
the neighborhood right now!

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:46.830
What?!

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:09.040
Get friendly enough with that person
that you're able to have tea together.

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.000
Understood.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:20.250
Make sure to keep a poker face
for the next three minutes.

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.200
Got it!

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:25.750
Wh-why are you giving
me the silent treatment? I'm scared...

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:29.250
I'm gonna cry...

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:31.330
Alright.

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:40.830
Record

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.870
Not bad.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:49.120
At long last, tomorrow's
your final exam for joining Tsukikage.

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:49.950
Okay!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:54.910
You'll have to catch Mei Yachiyo within
the school grounds within a set amount of time.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:57.620
When it's time to start, we'll let you know.

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:04.830
Seems your body's in peak form.
Now keep it up and prepare for the test.

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.040
Got it!

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:14.000
As far as preparing, all I can really do is make sure
I'm in perfect physical condition...

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:14.000
Hey, Momo-chan.

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:15.950
Momo-chan, I'm calling you!

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:19.160
Ah, Moroboshi-san, hello.

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:21.540
A little cold of you to pass by without stopping, isn't it?

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:23.830
I was lost in thought...

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:28.250
Bet you're being worked pretty hard
since joining Hanzomon's dojo, huh?

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:31.160
Hey, here's a freebie. Build up your strength.

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:33.540
Thank you!

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:38.410
Smells good...

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:45.250
Your croquettes really do taste great, Moroboshi-san.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:47.290
Our methods of preparation
are different from other shops'.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.830
"Preparation"... I see...

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:53.700
Thanks again for the croquette!

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:55.040
S-sure...

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.040
Hm?

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.370
Therefore, this formula...

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:05.080
Sir, I'm not feeling well,
so I'm going to head to the nurse's office.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:06.910
Will you be alright on your own?

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:07.790
Yes.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.250
Let's continue.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:16.000
Accordingly, if you use this formula
and expand the expression...

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:20.250
Then in this case, A comes out to 3
and Y comes out to 2.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:20.230
Your final exam starts now.
You have until this class ends to complete it.
I'll take notes for you.
Do your best!
-Goe

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:24.200
Sir, I'm worried about Yachiyo-san,
so I'm going to check on her!

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:26.910
I didn't see that coming!

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:35.500
Two months ago, all I could do was watch her go...

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:36.750
But now...!

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:49.750
Is that...?

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:53.500
That was a close call.
You're actually Sagami-san, aren't you?

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:56.120
You almost had me fooled!

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:59.370
Never thought you'd see through my disguise.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:04.000
Mei-chan, I've come to catch you.

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:06.660
Good going, Momochi.

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:09.580
Might as well make this exciting.

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:15.540
I'll make both my mind and body surge!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:34.000
Both of us are using Spyce right now.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:36.120
No way you can close the distance between us, right?!

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:37.500
Sure I can!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:38.410
How?!

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:41.000
Preparation is key!

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:43.660
Gah!

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:45.500
C'mere!

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:53.700
I did it!

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:55.450
This taste's the real thing!

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:56.910
What kinda taste is it?!

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:04.950
Yesterday she built a barricade in an unused
passageway and then baited her into running there, huh?

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:08.870
She passed the test...

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.330
For starters, it's stab-resistant and bulletproof...

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:20.950
and it also has stealth functionality
that makes it invisible to cameras.

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:23.620
Whoa...

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:26.330
And with that, you're now
a respectable member of Tsukikage.

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:28.120
Way to go.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:30.200
I was right to choose you.

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:33.080
To think you actually passed...

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:37.160
Anyway, when it comes to Tsukikage, I'm your senior.
I'm gonna use casual language with you, Momochi.

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:38.450
Alright! Fu-chan!

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:41.410
This will be your sword.

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:42.540
Momo.

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:50.000
My mentor also wielded a sword.

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:52.910
If you can master the blade,
you'll be the strongest of fighters.

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:54.410
Understood!

00:21:57.700 --> 00:22:00.620
Mentor, I've finished my training run!

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:02.370
You're right on time.

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:05.290
Wow, this looks delicious!

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:06.410
Did you make this?

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:09.620
Eat up so that you're ready for more training.

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:12.410
So you made all this to celebrate, huh?

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:14.830
Thank you... Mentor!

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:16.160
Don't mind if I do!

00:22:16.750 --> 00:22:18.330
Chew your food well.

00:22:32.290 --> 00:22:34.580
We're received some information from the traitor.

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:38.290
It might be a trap, but it's still worth acting on.

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:39.870
Let's get going on it.

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:42.700
Alright, my time has come!

00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:31.000
Next Episode

00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:31.000
Moryo

00:24:16.620 --> 00:24:20.250
Well then, we'll add Momo to the team
that's going to infiltrate the brothel.

00:24:20.250 --> 00:24:22.160
Drink it and cheer up.

00:24:22.160 --> 00:24:25.080
Alright, now it's finally my time to shine!

00:24:25.080 --> 00:24:27.290
Ah, looks like you're feeling motivated now, huh?

00:24:27.580 --> 00:24:30.040
I'll make both my mind and body surge!
